<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES INCH LOWER.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES INCH LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>edged lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell one basis-point to 3.04 percent.</p>
<p>			 January 17 fix	January 16 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.01 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.12 pct		3.13 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.19 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.27 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
